WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.763
The key numbers are convergence rates.

00:00:02.843 --> 00:00:07.774
Momentum SGD's expected squared gradient norm
decays exponentially,

00:00:07.854 --> 00:00:13.759
with exponent scaling as summed step sizes over p
times one-minus-alpha squared.

00:00:13.839 --> 00:00:19.070
Alpha zero recovers the SGD rate; near one it
reaches order one over T.
